      "domain": "arxiv.org",
      "rank": 4
    },
    {
      "title": "Longformer: The Long-Document Transformer",
      "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2004.05150",
      "snippet": "Iz Beltagy, Matthew E. Peters and Arman Cohan released Longformer in 2020, introducing sparse attention to handle sequences of 4,096 tokens and beyond. The paper is frequently cited in document understanding and summarization research and is indexed in Semantic Scholar with author and citation metadata.",
